WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:35.450
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:35.720 --> 01:36.160
No, Long.

3
01:36.160 --> 01:38.890
This doesn't sound like something you would say.

4
01:38.920 --> 01:40.800
I... That's what I think.

5
01:40.800 --> 01:43.280
Did you take this case to win?

6
01:43.759 --> 01:46.000
When you left Honghu to work on your own,

7
01:46.720 --> 01:48.039
was it to make money?

8
01:48.479 --> 01:49.759
Wasn't it to help Old Pan

9
01:49.759 --> 01:52.080
and the sick people in Fuyuan Village?

10
01:53.360 --> 01:56.220
Because they were deceived and bullied by Wangang.

11
01:57.080 --> 01:58.640
No one told them the truth.

12
01:59.560 --> 02:01.280
No one spoke up for them.

13
02:01.280 --> 02:02.610
No one stood up for them.

14
02:03.080 --> 02:05.440
Didn't you step forward to uphold justice?

15
02:05.440 --> 02:06.800
If you back out now,

16
02:07.160 --> 02:09.090
they will have absolutely no hope.

17
02:09.800 --> 02:12.000
You're not the type to quit halfway.

18
02:15.160 --> 02:16.760
I just can't hold on anymore.

19
02:18.760 --> 02:19.760
It's too hard.

20
02:20.880 --> 02:23.440
I really can't hold on anymore, Dad.

21
02:26.000 --> 02:27.400
Long...

22
02:28.280 --> 02:30.320
Do you remember when you were in school?

23
02:30.320 --> 02:31.640
A few boys in your class

24
02:31.640 --> 02:33.680
specifically bullied a girl with glasses,

25
02:33.680 --> 02:35.680
throwing her stationery and her schoolbag.

26
02:35.680 --> 02:36.560
Then you saw it,

27
02:36.560 --> 02:37.800
rushed up to fight them,

28
02:37.800 --> 02:38.880
and scratched the face

29
02:38.880 --> 02:41.200
of one of those boys.

30
02:43.079 --> 02:43.440
And then,

31
02:43.440 --> 02:45.570
they got older students to corner you,

32
02:45.680 --> 02:47.140
asking if you would give in

33
02:47.520 --> 02:49.680
and if you still dared to be a busybody.

34
02:50.160 --> 02:51.490
You didn't give in then.

35
02:51.680 --> 02:52.880
You didn't back down.

36
02:52.880 --> 02:55.920
You said, 'Draw a sword and help when seeing injustice.

37
02:55.920 --> 02:57.120
My dad taught me that.

38
02:57.560 --> 02:58.920
Do you think you're right to bully people?'

39
02:58.920 --> 02:59.920
I just wouldn't give in.

40
02:59.920 --> 03:01.320
I'll fight you to the end.

41
03:02.280 --> 03:03.540
Your Brother Jun is now

42
03:04.480 --> 03:06.320
approaching sixty.

43
03:06.960 --> 03:09.690
I really don't have anything special to show off.

44
03:10.640 --> 03:12.480
The only thing I can show off,

45
03:12.960 --> 03:14.890
the thing that makes me most proud,

46
03:14.920 --> 03:18.800
is that I have a brave and righteous daughter.

47
03:44.079 --> 03:45.010
Think carefully

48
03:45.600 --> 03:48.960
about what kind of lawyer you really want to be.

49
03:49.840 --> 03:50.640
Director.

50
03:52.079 --> 03:52.960
I resign.

51
03:53.400 --> 03:56.480
A lawyer's sword must be wielded for the defenseless.

52
03:56.480 --> 03:58.240
Lawyer Xiao, I want to appeal.

53
03:58.440 --> 04:00.520
Why do you say I didn't save my child?

54
04:00.720 --> 04:03.760
The scales must be balanced for the voiceless.

55
04:04.360 --> 04:06.320
I solemnly swear

56
04:06.400 --> 04:08.760
to voluntarily dedicate myself to the political and legal cause,

57
04:08.760 --> 04:10.080
be loyal to the people,

58
04:10.080 --> 04:11.880
uphold humanistic values,

59
04:11.880 --> 04:13.640
wield the sword of justice,

60
04:13.640 --> 04:15.280
and hold the scales of righteousness.

61
04:15.280 --> 04:16.760
I went back to Tieling a couple of days ago

62
04:16.760 --> 04:17.880
and saw Wu Lian.

63
04:17.880 --> 04:19.240
She insisted I give this letter to you.

64
04:19.240 --> 04:20.880
I made a cross-stitch.

65
04:20.880 --> 04:22.040
It's just a small token of my appreciation.

66
04:22.040 --> 04:24.400
Aunt Fang embroidered all our names on it.

67
04:26.200 --> 04:27.400
Thank you, everyone.

68
04:28.280 --> 04:29.160
Thank you.

69
04:31.280 --> 04:32.340
So whatever you do,

70
04:32.440 --> 04:34.000
I will support you without hesitation.

71
04:34.000 --> 04:37.130
Lawyer Xiao, I don't want money and I won't take up space.

72
04:37.280 --> 04:38.840
Just give me a chance to learn.

73
04:38.840 --> 04:41.680
Xiao Longnv Law Firm Reopens

74
04:41.880 --> 04:45.760
Happy opening.

75
04:45.800 --> 04:47.320
Start over.

76
04:47.320 --> 04:48.080
Lawyer Xiao.

77
04:49.800 --> 04:51.320
This client, Xiao Jun,

78
04:52.880 --> 04:53.960
has a favor to ask.

79
04:55.560 --> 04:56.400
What is it?

80
04:57.800 --> 04:58.600
Please

81
05:00.120 --> 05:01.720
keep fighting this lawsuit.

82
05:02.440 --> 05:03.360
And please

83
05:04.760 --> 05:05.820
protect yourself.

84
05:53.720 --> 05:55.780
Welcome to Sister Pang's Bathhouse.

85
05:56.120 --> 05:57.040
Did you notice?

86
05:57.360 --> 06:00.090
The place upstairs hasn't opened for three days.

87
06:00.400 --> 06:03.060
Is Xiao Longnv's law firm going out of business?

88
06:03.400 --> 06:04.800
At the very beginning,

89
06:04.800 --> 06:06.530
I didn't think she'd last long.

90
06:06.640 --> 06:08.080
Making it this far

91
06:08.080 --> 06:09.640
is already a miracle.

92
06:10.120 --> 06:10.840
Why did she have to

93
06:10.840 --> 06:12.920
clash with Wangang?

94
06:12.920 --> 06:13.640
If she hadn't,

95
06:13.640 --> 06:15.240
wouldn't she be doing pretty well right now?

96
06:15.240 --> 06:17.400
Yeah, it's a bit of a pity.

97
06:17.680 --> 06:19.480
She's actually a decent person.

98
06:21.400 --> 06:22.600
Want to go upstairs and sit for a bit?

99
06:22.600 --> 06:23.360
No, no, no.

100
06:23.400 --> 06:24.400
I'll leave you to it.

101
06:24.400 --> 06:25.440
You go ahead.

102
06:26.440 --> 06:27.520
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

103
06:27.520 --> 06:30.980
She hasn't been here for three days. Who knew she'd come today?

104
06:36.960 --> 06:37.600
Luo Zhi.

105
06:37.760 --> 06:38.600
Director.

106
06:38.800 --> 06:39.730
Why are you here?

107
06:40.280 --> 06:42.520
I thought I'd come and sweep the floor.

108
06:42.880 --> 06:44.010
Sweeping the floor.

109
06:46.480 --> 06:48.140
The windows are all replaced.

110
06:49.480 --> 06:50.740
He's done a lot of work.

111
06:56.280 --> 06:58.280
That's why I say Luo Zhi is reliable.

112
06:58.360 --> 06:59.440
Unlike Miaomiao.

113
06:59.680 --> 07:01.400
When she says she's on vacation, she really takes a vacation.

114
07:01.400 --> 07:02.600
This kid really is...

115
07:02.680 --> 07:03.120
No.

116
07:04.240 --> 07:06.440
I... I arrived earlier than him.

117
07:06.440 --> 07:06.840
Right, right.

118
07:06.840 --> 07:08.480
You're really easy to provoke.

119
07:08.480 --> 07:10.740
One sentence and you gave yourself away.

120
07:14.560 --> 07:15.400
Sister Long.

121
07:16.200 --> 07:18.200
We didn't disobey you.

122
07:18.320 --> 07:21.120
We couldn't stay at home for another day.

123
07:21.120 --> 07:22.040
We just wanted to work.

124
07:22.040 --> 07:23.640
I missed you and the law firm.

125
07:23.880 --> 07:25.040
I love working.

126
07:25.480 --> 07:26.600
I love working too.

127
07:26.840 --> 07:28.200
This is our law firm.

128
07:28.440 --> 07:30.640
We should face difficulties together.

129
07:31.360 --> 07:32.159
We...

130
07:33.040 --> 07:34.700
We don't want to be deserters.

131
07:40.600 --> 07:41.360
You two...

132
07:44.960 --> 07:46.560
You two came back.

133
07:49.960 --> 07:50.920
Thank you.

134
07:52.800 --> 07:54.200
What do you mean, Sister?

135
07:54.200 --> 07:55.330
I've figured it out.

136
07:56.280 --> 07:58.720
The three of us will stand together

137
07:59.360 --> 08:00.680
and fight the evil forces head-on.

138
08:00.680 --> 08:03.320
Right. We live in a society ruled by law, so we're not afraid of them.

139
08:03.320 --> 08:04.080
Yes.

140
08:04.840 --> 08:05.840
Let's get to work.

141
08:07.280 --> 08:08.160
Great.

142
08:08.400 --> 08:10.130
Fighting against evil forces.

143
08:10.880 --> 08:11.640
Get to work.

144
08:33.400 --> 08:34.039
Bowen.

145
08:34.760 --> 08:35.880
We need to reorganize

146
08:35.880 --> 08:37.919
the organizational structure of Wangang Group.

147
08:37.919 --> 08:41.580
Sort out all the information since the establishment of Wangang.

148
08:51.200 --> 08:52.800
You know better than I do

149
08:53.400 --> 08:55.060
what Sun Zhuoli is capable of.

150
09:02.800 --> 09:03.880
You didn't know about this?

151
09:03.880 --> 09:05.560
No, I haven't heard of it.

152
09:05.760 --> 09:07.160
Hey guys, having a drink?

153
09:09.120 --> 09:12.240
Why isn't the injured guy here?

154
09:12.240 --> 09:12.960
Injured?

155
09:14.160 --> 09:14.890
He went back.

156
09:15.120 --> 09:15.960
Went back?

157
09:16.360 --> 09:17.960
Went back to his hometown?

158
09:18.040 --> 09:19.880
Look, I specially prepared this

159
09:19.880 --> 09:21.160
medicinal liquor for bruises.

160
09:21.160 --> 09:22.720
It's my family's secret recipe.

161
09:22.720 --> 09:24.440
If he went back to his hometown, I can mail it to him.

162
09:24.440 --> 09:25.570
Give me his address.

163
09:28.800 --> 09:29.320
That's fine.

164
09:29.320 --> 09:31.040
I'll ask Dali later.

165
09:31.240 --> 09:33.040
I'll get the address and mail it.

166
09:33.760 --> 09:34.680
To show

167
09:34.680 --> 09:37.200
my sincerity in making friends with you all,

168
09:37.200 --> 09:38.600
I'll chug a bottle, okay?

169
09:38.600 --> 09:39.360
Come on.

170
09:41.920 --> 09:42.720
One bottle.

171
09:45.600 --> 09:46.280
I'll chug it.

172
09:46.280 --> 09:47.880
You guys drink as you please.

173
09:54.840 --> 09:55.880
It's been years since I chugged.

174
09:55.880 --> 09:57.440
I made a little mistake.

175
09:57.880 --> 09:58.880
But you can all see

176
09:58.880 --> 10:00.540
that I'm an honest man, right?

177
10:02.120 --> 10:03.400
See? Right.

178
10:03.400 --> 10:05.000
This is the right vibe.

179
10:05.120 --> 10:06.400
We brothers

180
10:06.400 --> 10:07.640
should all be lively.

181
10:25.280 --> 10:26.320
I'm so dirty.

182
10:31.200 --> 10:33.320
The M&A is settled, and the board seats are being adjusted.

183
10:33.320 --> 10:34.520
Why am I not included?

184
10:36.600 --> 10:40.000
Board seats affect the company's management structure.

185
10:40.160 --> 10:43.520
We must comprehensively consider personal ability, qualifications,

186
10:43.520 --> 10:45.920
and long-term contributions to the group.

187
10:45.920 --> 10:48.000
You haven't been with the company long enough.

188
10:48.000 --> 10:49.320
Gain some experience for a few years.

189
10:49.320 --> 10:50.320
There's no one else here.

190
10:50.320 --> 10:52.120
You don't have to give me the bureaucratic talk.

191
10:52.120 --> 10:53.480
Whether I have the qualifications or not,

192
10:53.480 --> 10:55.120
isn't it just a matter of your word?

193
10:55.120 --> 10:56.800
Or maybe you just don't want me on the board at all.

194
10:56.800 --> 10:59.260
You're just stringing me along, aren't you?

195
10:59.760 --> 11:00.760
Unbelievable.

196
11:02.280 --> 11:03.200
Get out.

197
11:03.880 --> 11:04.960
I said get out!

198
11:06.520 --> 11:08.680
Look at yourself right now.

199
11:08.880 --> 11:11.480
You're impetuous and eager for quick success.

200
11:11.680 --> 11:12.480
Didn't I tell you

201
11:12.480 --> 11:14.600
that your status is different now?

202
11:15.160 --> 11:16.760
Stop acting like you used to,

203
11:16.800 --> 11:18.400
like some street punk.

204
11:20.320 --> 11:22.000
I've always been a punk!

205
11:22.560 --> 11:23.690
Whose fault is that?

206
11:23.720 --> 11:25.320
Don't you know it yourself?

207
11:26.040 --> 11:28.280
Now you think I'm an embarrassment, huh?

208
11:28.280 --> 11:30.440
Wan Jiliang, don't think I don't know.

209
11:31.480 --> 11:33.080
You just can't have kids anymore,

210
11:33.080 --> 11:34.760
so you came to claim me as a ready-made son.

211
11:34.760 --> 11:36.160
Is that how you talk to me?

212
11:36.400 --> 11:37.800
Do you still see me as your father?

213
11:37.800 --> 11:39.480
Have you ever been a father to me for even a day?

214
11:39.480 --> 11:41.360
When my mom and I were out there

215
11:41.360 --> 11:43.120
and got kicked out, where were you?

216
11:43.120 --> 11:45.440
Where were you when I was called a bastard?

217
11:45.440 --> 11:47.170
Where were you when my mom died?

218
11:47.920 --> 11:48.280
I really...

219
11:48.280 --> 11:48.840
Dad.

220
11:52.560 --> 11:54.560
Fine, you look down on me, right?

221
11:55.200 --> 11:57.440
I'll fight for this board seat myself

222
11:57.440 --> 11:58.480
to prove it to you.

223
12:01.400 --> 12:03.260
What can you fight for without me?

224
12:05.800 --> 12:07.720
What are you looking at? Move.

225
12:08.440 --> 12:09.280
What's wrong?

226
12:09.480 --> 12:10.560
Didn't you hear?

227
12:11.200 --> 12:13.040
I saw Assistant Wan storm out

228
12:13.040 --> 12:14.720
of Director Wan's office.

229
12:14.760 --> 12:16.280
These two are really something.

230
12:16.280 --> 12:18.800
They should just talk about family matters behind closed doors at home.

231
12:18.800 --> 12:20.320
Why make such a big scene here?

232
12:20.320 --> 12:21.280
Alright, stop gossiping.

233
12:21.280 --> 12:23.560
There are so many documents. Hurry up and find them.

234
12:23.560 --> 12:25.080
Sorry I'm late.

235
12:26.400 --> 12:27.360
You call this late?

236
12:27.360 --> 12:29.040
You're early.

237
12:29.120 --> 12:31.200
If you were any later, we'd be off work.

238
12:31.200 --> 12:32.660
Something came up at home.

239
12:34.640 --> 12:36.080
You're buying coffee later.

240
12:36.080 --> 12:36.720
Okay.

241
12:39.640 --> 12:40.440
Jiliang Yiri.

242
12:41.560 --> 12:42.200
Geliang.

243
12:42.160 --> 12:42.890
Wan Jiliang.

244
12:58.920 --> 12:59.980
Thank you, Master.

245
13:03.680 --> 13:04.410
Smells good.

246
13:04.560 --> 13:07.840
You must be exhausted from the recent merger.

247
13:08.560 --> 13:10.220
Do you want to take a vacation?

248
13:11.000 --> 13:13.860
The farmers' case is about to go to the second trial.

249
13:14.040 --> 13:15.500
Let's wait until I'm done.

250
13:15.520 --> 13:17.120
Is this case that difficult?

251
13:17.880 --> 13:18.920
Doesn't it involve

252
13:18.920 --> 13:21.120
an old score from over twenty years ago?

253
13:21.840 --> 13:23.570
It is indeed a bit of a headache.

254
13:24.800 --> 13:28.840
Master, why don't you give me some pointers?

255
13:30.800 --> 13:32.200
What exactly should I do?

256
13:37.480 --> 13:39.480
You're coming to me for the answers.

257
13:45.800 --> 13:47.360
These old accounts

258
13:48.160 --> 13:51.280
are like the mold spots on this tea cake.

259
13:52.400 --> 13:53.530
They are an eyesore,

260
13:54.040 --> 13:55.500
but if you scrape them off,

261
13:55.560 --> 13:56.760
you can still brew it.

262
13:57.880 --> 13:59.940
But this mold spot in Fuyuan Village,

263
14:00.040 --> 14:01.970
how can it be scraped off so easily?

264
14:02.720 --> 14:04.480
Not only is it hard to scrape off,

265
14:04.480 --> 14:06.440
but it also easily seeps deep inside.

266
14:06.440 --> 14:08.880
In the end, the tea cake is ruined.

267
14:09.360 --> 14:10.520
No matter how you brew it,

268
14:10.520 --> 14:12.320
the tea won't taste good, right?

269
14:12.760 --> 14:14.420
Actually, the taste of the tea

270
14:15.160 --> 14:16.440
when brewed

271
14:17.640 --> 14:20.760
depends on the person brewing it.

272
14:24.520 --> 14:24.960
Right.

273
14:26.600 --> 14:29.280
It depends on the person brewing it.

274
14:38.360 --> 14:41.090
Sister Long, the date for the second trial is set,

275
14:41.160 --> 14:43.160
but we still lack evidence.

276
14:43.200 --> 14:44.520
We must get the groundwater samples

277
14:44.520 --> 14:46.320
for testing as soon as possible.

278
14:47.240 --> 14:49.500
But the villagers are very wary of us now.

279
14:49.880 --> 14:52.010
It'll be hard to get them to cooperate.

280
14:52.760 --> 14:53.960
Let's think of a way

281
14:53.960 --> 14:56.640
to make some noise and distract them.

282
14:56.920 --> 14:58.120
We'll act after dark.

283
14:59.320 --> 15:01.440
Uncles and aunts,

284
15:01.440 --> 15:03.600
gather at the village entrance for a while.

285
15:03.600 --> 15:05.640
There's a big show today.

286
15:05.720 --> 15:07.480
I guarantee it'll make you laugh.

287
15:07.480 --> 15:08.000
Come on.

288
15:08.240 --> 15:08.760
Hurry.

289
15:09.000 --> 15:09.760
Well,

290
15:09.760 --> 15:11.320
as the saying goes,

291
15:11.480 --> 15:12.680
I'd rather skip a meal

292
15:12.680 --> 15:13.800
than miss an Errenzhuan show.

293
15:13.800 --> 15:14.360
Yeah.

294
15:14.360 --> 15:15.240
Folks.

295
15:15.240 --> 15:17.720
We're here for a charity performance today.

296
15:17.760 --> 15:21.400
Every household can get a bag of eggs

297
15:22.000 --> 15:23.360
on the left.

298
15:23.920 --> 15:26.440
Get your eggs. Get your eggs.

299
15:26.720 --> 15:27.920
They're right ahead.

300
15:35.240 --> 15:38.560
In the first lunar month...

301
15:38.560 --> 15:39.160
Director.

302
15:39.680 --> 15:41.440
Could there be a well here?

303
15:42.520 --> 15:43.640
I asked around.

304
15:43.800 --> 15:44.640
In 1999,

305
15:44.640 --> 15:47.480
the village raised money to dig a well here.

306
15:47.520 --> 15:48.760
Later, when tap water was connected,

307
15:48.760 --> 15:50.160
this well was abandoned.

308
15:50.720 --> 15:51.240
Let's split up.

309
15:51.240 --> 15:53.040
You go that way. I'll go this way.

310
16:05.200 --> 16:06.000
Luo Zhi.

311
16:06.360 --> 16:07.400
Come here. Come here. Come here.

312
16:07.400 --> 16:08.400
Look, look, look.

313
16:11.920 --> 16:12.640
Right?

314
16:12.640 --> 16:14.900
It really is. But how do we open this lock?

315
16:15.080 --> 16:16.000
By force.

316
16:18.920 --> 16:20.120
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

317
16:23.320 --> 16:30.920
The older sister rolls up her sleeves.

318
16:30.920 --> 16:32.980
And the younger sister shakes it off.

319
16:33.680 --> 16:34.880
It's open. It's open.

320
16:41.760 --> 16:42.960
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

321
16:46.240 --> 16:47.640
I hear something.

322
16:54.200 --> 16:55.040
Again, again.

323
16:55.040 --> 16:55.640
One more.

324
16:57.880 --> 16:59.160
Over there. Hurry.

325
16:59.680 --> 17:00.240
Hurry.

326
17:00.440 --> 17:01.040
Okay.

327
17:02.720 --> 17:04.980
Hurry, hurry, hurry. Someone's coming.

328
17:15.720 --> 17:16.920
What is this?

329
17:18.040 --> 17:19.119
They've run away.

330
17:20.040 --> 17:21.369
Don't let them get away.

331
17:21.680 --> 17:22.560
Go after them.

332
17:28.119 --> 17:28.650
Let's go.

333
17:30.960 --> 17:32.880
Got it, got it. Let's go. Hurry.

334
17:32.880 --> 17:33.200
Hurry, hurry.

335
17:33.200 --> 17:35.600
Give me a hand. Hurry, give it to me. Come on.

336
17:35.640 --> 17:36.320
Stop.

337
17:36.320 --> 17:36.840
They're catching up.

338
17:36.840 --> 17:37.560
Don't run.

339
17:38.000 --> 17:38.640
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

340
17:38.640 --> 17:39.920
Throw eggs at him.

341
17:40.240 --> 17:41.080
Hit him.

342
17:41.680 --> 17:42.400
Hit him.

343
17:44.760 --> 17:45.360
Get in.

344
17:45.800 --> 17:46.840
Go, go.

345
17:47.680 --> 17:48.800
Hurry, hurry, hurry. Drive, drive, drive.

346
17:48.800 --> 17:50.530
Close the door. Close the door.

347
17:55.720 --> 17:56.880
A bunch of losers.

348
17:57.480 --> 17:59.810
You can't even handle such a small matter.

349
17:59.840 --> 18:01.040
I'm sorry, boss.

350
18:01.920 --> 18:04.160
I'll go find that female lawyer right now.

351
18:04.160 --> 18:04.920
Forget it.

352
18:11.920 --> 18:13.800
I have a new idea.

353
18:22.640 --> 18:25.720
The mercury content exceeds the national standard by 17 times.

354
18:25.720 --> 18:26.720
What's the difference between this

355
18:26.720 --> 18:28.440
and adding arsenic to the water?

356
18:28.440 --> 18:30.400
Let's see what Wangang has to say this time.

357
18:30.400 --> 18:31.000
But

358
18:31.000 --> 18:32.840
they have a test report now.

359
18:33.120 --> 18:34.280
We have one too,

360
18:34.360 --> 18:36.560
and the results are completely opposite.

361
18:36.560 --> 18:37.800
If this goes to court,

362
18:38.400 --> 18:39.760
who will the judge believe?

363
18:39.760 --> 18:41.480
Ours, for sure.

364
18:41.560 --> 18:43.480
This result is from a provincial institution,

365
18:43.480 --> 18:46.000
much more reliable than the one Wanzhuoli found.

366
18:46.000 --> 18:47.800
If the judge thinks it's not enough,

367
18:47.800 --> 18:49.000
we'll just find another one.

368
18:49.000 --> 18:50.080
If not, we'll go to Beijing to look for it.

369
18:50.080 --> 18:51.480
That's too much trouble.

370
18:51.600 --> 18:54.200
Think about it. Wan Gang is rich and powerful,

371
18:54.200 --> 18:55.280
and ruthless.

372
18:55.800 --> 18:58.000
We can't leave any room for variables.

373
18:58.880 --> 19:01.360
This report at least confirms

374
19:01.360 --> 19:04.420
that their village's groundwater is indeed polluted.

375
19:04.520 --> 19:05.760
So, how do you think

376
19:06.480 --> 19:07.240
Wan Gang

377
19:07.760 --> 19:09.720
disposed of these pollutants

378
19:09.720 --> 19:10.680
back then,

379
19:10.680 --> 19:13.200
to allow the pollution to last until now

380
19:13.320 --> 19:15.800
and remain undiscovered for so long?

381
19:16.400 --> 19:17.280
Burying them.

382
19:18.240 --> 19:20.300
Exactly. They must have buried them.

383
19:20.320 --> 19:23.560
If we can find and dig up the waste,

384
19:24.240 --> 19:25.560
wouldn't that be solid evidence?

385
19:25.560 --> 19:27.280
But Fuyuan Village is so big,

386
19:27.320 --> 19:29.720
and there are so many places to bury things.

387
19:30.280 --> 19:31.880
Where do we dig for the waste?

388
19:32.560 --> 19:33.890
It's been over 20 years,

389
19:34.280 --> 19:35.080
and now

390
19:36.280 --> 19:38.000
the waste can still affect

391
19:38.000 --> 19:39.200
Mr. Pan's farm.

392
19:39.920 --> 19:41.050
What does that mean?

393
19:42.800 --> 19:44.240
It means there's a huge amount of it.

394
19:44.240 --> 19:47.080
With such a massive amount of waste buried underground,

395
19:47.080 --> 19:48.760
they'd rather go to great lengths

396
19:48.760 --> 19:50.280
to supply them with tap water

397
19:50.280 --> 19:51.520
than dig it out.

398
19:52.680 --> 19:54.440
What does that mean?

399
19:54.880 --> 19:56.880
It means it's inconvenient to dig.

400
19:58.200 --> 19:59.480
This is the map of Fuyuan Village.

401
19:59.480 --> 20:01.320
It hasn't changed much over the years.

402
20:01.320 --> 20:02.440
But look here.

403
20:02.960 --> 20:03.920
This highway

404
20:04.200 --> 20:04.760
was only built after 2000.

405
20:04.760 --> 20:06.290
It only existed after 2000.

406
20:06.760 --> 20:07.920
I got it.

407
20:08.040 --> 20:10.280
The waste burial site must be very close to the highway.

408
20:10.280 --> 20:11.120
If they dig,

409
20:11.120 --> 20:13.120
passing cars would be able to see it.

410
20:21.640 --> 20:22.500
Get ready to go.

411
20:59.360 --> 21:01.090
What's the big occasion today?

412
21:02.480 --> 21:03.520
Everyone is here.

413
21:05.760 --> 21:07.490
Looking for something, right?

414
21:09.200 --> 21:10.040
You're late.

415
21:10.760 --> 21:11.800
Too late.

416
21:12.560 --> 21:13.440
It's gone.

417
21:13.760 --> 21:16.040
Search carefully.

418
21:28.840 --> 21:30.120
What do you mean?

419
21:30.400 --> 21:32.560
Of course, I'm doing my filial duty

420
21:32.560 --> 21:35.240
to solve your problems.

421
21:35.640 --> 21:36.800
What else?

422
21:37.680 --> 21:40.760
Doing this will easily alert the enemy.

423
21:42.440 --> 21:45.840
Dad, you're old.

424
21:45.840 --> 21:47.000
If I hadn't

425
21:47.400 --> 21:48.600
been one step ahead

426
21:48.720 --> 21:49.920
and struck first,

427
21:51.160 --> 21:54.800
they would have found it.

428
21:55.240 --> 21:56.320
Maybe right now,

429
21:56.320 --> 21:58.120
you wouldn't be sitting here so peacefully

430
21:58.120 --> 21:59.240
chatting with me.

431
22:01.200 --> 22:02.120
Well done.

432
22:12.280 --> 22:13.720
You finally praised me.

433
22:14.320 --> 22:15.320
Then does my

434
22:16.200 --> 22:18.040
performance deserve a reward?

435
22:24.840 --> 22:26.000
I've analyzed it.

436
22:26.560 --> 22:28.840
Wan Zhuoli dug out the waste.

437
22:29.080 --> 22:30.480
No matter where it's transported,

438
22:30.480 --> 22:32.320
a transport fleet is needed.

439
22:32.640 --> 22:33.640
Speaking of this,

440
22:33.720 --> 22:35.800
it's my four uncles' line of work.

441
22:36.360 --> 22:37.960
Please ask around, uncles,

442
22:38.160 --> 22:39.320
if any fleet has recently

443
22:39.320 --> 22:40.880
picked up goods from Fuyuan Village

444
22:40.880 --> 22:42.000
and where they were taken.

445
22:42.000 --> 22:44.520
I'll leave this matter in your hands.

446
22:44.600 --> 22:45.640
No problem, Xiaolong.

447
22:45.640 --> 22:47.080
Leave it to us.

448
22:47.440 --> 22:48.400
For Mr. Pan's case,

449
22:48.400 --> 22:50.840
the notice for the second trial has been issued.

450
22:50.840 --> 22:51.920
Before the trial starts,

451
22:51.920 --> 22:54.040
if we don't get solid evidence,

452
22:54.280 --> 22:56.760
I think the outcome will be tough.

453
22:57.880 --> 22:59.680
What are you all standing around for?

454
22:59.680 --> 23:01.400
Hurry up and get moving.

455
23:01.400 --> 23:02.040
Let's go.

456
23:02.040 --> 23:02.880
Let's go first.

457
23:02.880 --> 23:03.920
Thank you, Uncle.

458
23:04.040 --> 23:05.080
It's nothing. Don't worry.

459
23:05.080 --> 23:06.040
Over the past two days, taking advantage of

460
23:06.040 --> 23:08.440
the opportunity to reorganize the group's organizational structure,

461
23:08.440 --> 23:10.240
I went through the previous project materials again.

462
23:10.240 --> 23:12.120
I checked the project terms, capital flows,

463
23:12.120 --> 23:13.520
and approval records,

464
23:13.520 --> 23:15.200
and only found a few minor issues.

465
23:15.200 --> 23:16.800
There's really not a single flaw

466
23:16.800 --> 23:18.600
to be found in Mr. Wan.

467
23:18.760 --> 23:20.040
Especially when it comes to

468
23:20.040 --> 23:21.970
tax audits and financial reports.

469
23:22.160 --> 23:23.920
Either he's truly clean,

470
23:24.040 --> 23:26.770
or he has an expert guiding him behind the scenes.

471
23:32.520 --> 23:33.240
An expert.

472
23:34.160 --> 23:34.840
Perhaps.

473
23:35.160 --> 23:35.800
Boss,

474
23:35.800 --> 23:37.120
what should we do now?

475
23:38.040 --> 23:38.880
Keep investigating.

476
23:38.880 --> 23:40.410
Change the angle this time.

477
23:40.440 --> 23:41.960
Don't look for what's wrong,

478
23:41.960 --> 23:44.640
but look for why it's so right.

479
23:48.240 --> 23:48.800
Come in.

480
23:49.880 --> 23:50.480
Lawyer Li.

481
23:50.920 --> 23:52.840
Wangang wants us to provide

482
23:52.840 --> 23:54.360
a recommended list of building material suppliers

483
23:54.360 --> 23:55.960
for the resort development.

484
23:56.040 --> 23:57.000
I've finished compiling it.

485
23:57.000 --> 23:58.330
You just need to sign it.

486
24:24.960 --> 24:25.560
Come on.

487
24:25.920 --> 24:26.880
Brothers!

488
24:26.880 --> 24:28.720
Today, let's congratulate Dali

489
24:28.720 --> 24:30.600
on officially joining the board of directors.

490
24:30.600 --> 24:32.840
Congratulations, Brother Li! Brother Li!

491
24:32.840 --> 24:33.800
Cheers.

492
24:37.120 --> 24:38.120
Let me tell you.

493
24:38.680 --> 24:40.480
I deserve this from God.

494
24:40.720 --> 24:42.850
It was bound to be mine sooner or later.

495
24:42.880 --> 24:44.010
But this isn't over.

496
24:44.160 --> 24:45.090
What do you mean?

497
24:45.120 --> 24:47.960
I'm going to climb higher on the board of directors in the future.

498
24:47.960 --> 24:49.080
You definitely will.

499
24:49.080 --> 24:50.320
Do you guys support me

500
24:50.680 --> 24:51.400
or not?

501
24:51.560 --> 24:52.440
We support you.

502
24:52.880 --> 24:53.240
Dali.

503
24:53.240 --> 24:55.840
Do you know how awesome you are right now?

504
24:55.840 --> 24:56.400
What?

505
24:56.600 --> 24:57.640
You are now

506
24:57.640 --> 25:00.120
a landmark figure in Leyang City,

507
25:00.120 --> 25:01.320
a tourist attraction. So...

508
25:01.320 --> 25:01.880
That's too much.

509
25:01.880 --> 25:05.000
Now that you've achieved such greatness,

510
25:05.000 --> 25:06.960
I think you really don't need

511
25:07.200 --> 25:09.320
to sweat the small stuff.

512
25:09.320 --> 25:12.040
Like that old man Xiao Jun,

513
25:12.080 --> 25:13.720
why do you even bother with him?

514
25:13.720 --> 25:14.640
What are you talking about?

515
25:14.640 --> 25:17.920
Why are you still thinking about that family at a time like this?

516
25:17.920 --> 25:20.800
Is there something going on between you

517
25:20.800 --> 25:21.660
and that woman?

518
25:21.960 --> 25:23.640
No, I was just thinking.

519
25:23.640 --> 25:26.920
It's better to make friends than enemies.

520
25:27.000 --> 25:28.160
Be forgiving when possible.

521
25:28.160 --> 25:30.520
Just let them go and be done with it.

522
25:30.520 --> 25:32.360
Stop talking nonsense. Impossible.

523
25:32.360 --> 25:33.080
Let me tell you.

524
25:33.080 --> 25:35.600
If it weren't for them, I would have joined the board long ago.

525
25:35.600 --> 25:37.800
I wouldn't have had to wait until today.

526
25:38.560 --> 25:39.040
Right.

527
25:39.680 --> 25:40.800
I misspoke.

528
25:41.480 --> 25:43.160
I'll punish myself with a drink.

529
25:43.160 --> 25:43.960
Drink up.

530
25:43.960 --> 25:45.290
Let's all drink to that.

531
25:48.960 --> 25:50.090
What does this mean?

532
25:50.720 --> 25:51.880
Making me drive drunk?

533
25:51.880 --> 25:53.880
That's a bit too harsh of a punishment.

534
25:53.880 --> 25:56.120
Don't you like Land Rovers?

535
25:56.120 --> 25:57.880
Your name matches it too.

536
25:58.240 --> 26:01.080
Full of vigor. What a great meaning.

537
26:01.400 --> 26:02.960
This car is yours from now on.

538
26:02.960 --> 26:03.600
Just drive it.

539
26:03.600 --> 26:05.880
Dali, this is too expensive.

540
26:05.880 --> 26:06.920
Listen to me.

541
26:07.760 --> 26:10.560
If I'm enjoying life, would I let you suffer?

542
26:10.560 --> 26:13.160
Brothers united can overcome anything.

543
26:13.160 --> 26:15.200
Let's be at the top together.

544
26:30.600 --> 26:32.440
Lawyer Li, we followed your lead

545
26:32.440 --> 26:33.880
and indeed found some problems.

546
26:33.880 --> 26:34.560
These entities above

547
26:34.560 --> 26:37.090
that have had multiple dealings with Wangang

548
26:37.200 --> 26:39.660
actually have no real business operations.

549
26:39.840 --> 26:40.640
It is highly likely

550
26:40.640 --> 26:42.160
that they act as Mr. Wan's 'white gloves'

551
26:42.160 --> 26:43.640
to conduct financial transactions

552
26:43.640 --> 26:45.760
that appear flawless on the surface.

553
26:46.480 --> 26:47.680
I found a few here

554
26:47.960 --> 26:51.200
that were deregistered right after the contracts were fulfilled.

555
26:51.200 --> 26:52.120
Good job.

556
26:52.200 --> 26:53.280
Keep investigating

557
26:53.280 --> 26:54.520
and see what else you can dig up.

558
26:54.520 --> 26:55.440
Yes, boss.

559
26:57.160 --> 26:57.760
Come in.

560
26:59.560 --> 27:00.760
Are you Lawyer Li Xin?

561
27:00.960 --> 27:02.200
We are from the Justice Bureau.

562
27:02.200 --> 27:03.330
We received a report

563
27:03.480 --> 27:05.720
that in the Wangang Resort development project,

564
27:05.720 --> 27:07.040
you are suspected of taking kickbacks.

565
27:07.040 --> 27:08.480
Please cooperate with our investigation.

566
27:08.480 --> 27:09.480
Wait a minute, officer.

567
27:09.480 --> 27:10.940
Isn't there some mistake?

568
27:11.040 --> 27:12.200
How could Lawyer Li do that?

569
27:12.200 --> 27:14.440
This was signed and confirmed by you.

570
27:14.440 --> 27:16.320
Recommended list of building material suppliers.

571
27:16.320 --> 27:16.980
Among them,

572
27:17.080 --> 27:18.760
Hongye Building Materials quoted water glass at

573
27:18.760 --> 27:19.880
1,500 yuan per ton,

574
27:20.000 --> 27:21.320
while the average market price during the same period

575
27:21.320 --> 27:22.840
was only 1,000 yuan per ton.

576
27:22.840 --> 27:24.640
In addition, we seized

577
27:24.640 --> 27:25.960
500,000 yuan in cash from your car.

578
27:25.960 --> 27:27.160
According to the supplier,

579
27:27.160 --> 27:29.090
this is the kickback you demanded.

580
27:29.920 --> 27:31.440
Before the investigation results come out,

581
27:31.440 --> 27:32.760
we need to suspend your license.

582
27:32.760 --> 27:34.090
There must be a mistake.

583
27:34.200 --> 27:35.240
Lawyer Li, what happened?

584
27:35.240 --> 27:36.440
Lawyer Li! Lawyer Li!

585
28:08.000 --> 28:09.320
What's going on with you?

586
28:09.320 --> 28:10.650
Why were you suspended?

587
28:11.280 --> 28:12.480
You asked me out just to talk about this?

588
28:12.480 --> 28:13.800
Isn't this a big deal?

589
28:15.240 --> 28:16.640
So what if I'm suspended?

590
28:16.920 --> 28:18.180
Are you satisfied now?

591
28:18.440 --> 28:19.760
Why would I feel relieved?

592
28:19.760 --> 28:21.600
I'm getting angry just hearing about it.

593
28:21.600 --> 28:22.760
Tell me the truth.

594
28:23.080 --> 28:24.410
Did you offend someone?

595
28:25.200 --> 28:27.440
What if I deserved it?

596
28:27.440 --> 28:29.520
Impossible. I know you too well.

597
28:29.720 --> 28:31.600
Yes, sometimes you are annoying.

598
28:32.240 --> 28:33.600
But you're only annoying because

599
28:33.600 --> 28:35.760
you're so stubborn about everything.

600
28:35.880 --> 28:37.600
How could someone as stubborn as you

601
28:37.600 --> 28:39.000
possibly do anything

602
28:39.360 --> 28:41.560
that violates professional ethics?

603
28:42.840 --> 28:44.500
Thank you for believing in me.

604
28:44.800 --> 28:46.480
So what exactly happened?

605
28:46.680 --> 28:47.920
Now I can tell you.

606
28:49.160 --> 28:51.520
Regarding the development of Fuyuan Village,

607
28:51.520 --> 28:53.120
I did want to save the merger,

608
28:53.680 --> 28:55.410
but not to protect Wan Jiliang.

609
28:55.920 --> 28:59.000
What I want to protect are the tens of thousands of employees at Wangang.

610
28:59.000 --> 29:00.260
If Wangang collapses,

611
29:01.000 --> 29:02.660
they will all lose their jobs.

612
29:03.080 --> 29:03.680
Of course,

613
29:04.280 --> 29:06.010
after the merger is completed,

614
29:06.160 --> 29:08.480
whatever responsibilities Wangang should bear,

615
29:08.480 --> 29:10.680
and however much compensation it owes,

616
29:10.680 --> 29:12.320
it won't be able to escape them.

617
29:12.320 --> 29:14.040
As for the pollution in Fuyuan Village,

618
29:14.040 --> 29:15.280
I have been investigating it all along.

619
29:15.280 --> 29:16.740
What is certain now is that

620
29:17.280 --> 29:20.610
this is the consequence of Wan Jiliang's personal actions.

621
29:21.440 --> 29:22.560
So,

622
29:23.720 --> 29:25.480
your original plan was

623
29:26.120 --> 29:30.280
to separate Wangang from Wan Jiliang.

624
29:33.480 --> 29:37.520
But Wan Jiliang knew your purpose in advance

625
29:39.360 --> 29:40.600
and set you up.

626
29:41.480 --> 29:43.010
How could Wan Jiliang know?

627
29:43.360 --> 29:44.490
It was someone else.

628
29:44.960 --> 29:45.840
Someone else?

629
29:47.160 --> 29:48.890
Who else could know you so well?

630
29:50.200 --> 29:50.760
Yeah.

631
29:51.840 --> 29:53.500
Who else could know me so well?

632
29:58.080 --> 29:59.080
Master.

633
30:09.400 --> 30:10.040
Hello.

634
30:10.400 --> 30:12.400
Hello. Are you Li Guochen's family?

635
30:19.160 --> 30:20.360
Doctor, doctor.

636
30:20.720 --> 30:21.480
How is my dad?

637
30:22.080 --> 30:24.000
The patient has glioblastoma.

638
30:24.360 --> 30:26.720
It's a highly malignant brain tumor.

639
30:27.080 --> 30:30.280
From the imaging, it's already in the mid-to-late stage.

640
30:30.760 --> 30:31.890
Mid-to-late stage?

641
30:32.480 --> 30:34.520
The symptoms of this brain tumor are very obvious.

642
30:34.520 --> 30:35.760
Persistent headaches,

643
30:35.760 --> 30:36.760
memory loss.

644
30:36.880 --> 30:37.810
Slow reactions.

645
30:37.960 --> 30:39.880
These don't just appear out of nowhere.

646
30:39.880 --> 30:42.400
If you children had paid a little more attention,

647
30:42.400 --> 30:43.920
you would have noticed it long ago.

648
30:43.920 --> 30:45.580
It wouldn't have come to this,

649
30:45.640 --> 30:46.560
bringing him to the hospital only after he fainted.

650
30:46.560 --> 30:48.440
I saw you hadn't been there for a few days,

651
30:48.440 --> 30:49.640
so I thought I'd come see you.

652
30:49.640 --> 30:50.600
What do you mean a few days?

653
30:50.600 --> 30:51.800
Didn't I just go the day before yesterday?

654
30:51.800 --> 30:52.320
We were even putting things

655
30:52.320 --> 30:53.880
in the fridge together.

656
30:54.240 --> 30:55.240
Right, Xiaolong?

657
30:56.840 --> 30:57.480
Xiaoxin.

658
31:01.360 --> 31:02.920
Doctor, I'd like to ask,

659
31:03.520 --> 31:05.560
what is the approximate success rate of this surgery?

660
31:05.560 --> 31:07.360
It's hard to say.

661
31:07.680 --> 31:08.760
Probably

662
31:09.760 --> 31:10.680
fifty-fifty.

663
31:12.840 --> 31:13.440
By the way,

664
31:13.520 --> 31:15.320
you really should go thank

665
31:15.320 --> 31:17.680
the pedestrian who called the police and an ambulance.

666
31:17.680 --> 31:19.160
Huanghua Alley in the south of the city,

667
31:19.160 --> 31:20.920
there are so few pedestrians there.

668
31:20.920 --> 31:22.960
The patient fainted there.

669
31:23.160 --> 31:24.960
If he had been found any later,

670
31:25.680 --> 31:27.340
it would have been dangerous.

671
31:37.360 --> 31:38.960
Isn't Huanghua Alley...

672
31:39.120 --> 31:39.640
You...

673
31:57.720 --> 31:58.200
Son.

674
32:05.400 --> 32:06.040
Son.

675
32:06.520 --> 32:07.160
Son.

676
32:12.240 --> 32:12.920
Son, you...

677
32:13.880 --> 32:14.560
Wake up.

678
32:14.760 --> 32:15.680
Wake up, son.

679
32:17.120 --> 32:18.360
Son, wake up.

680
32:19.360 --> 32:20.000
Son.

681
32:20.400 --> 32:21.040
Son.

682
32:23.560 --> 32:24.320
Xiaoxin.

683
32:25.120 --> 32:25.880
Xiaoxin.

684
33:09.480 --> 33:10.680
My name is Li Guochen.

685
33:11.320 --> 33:12.980
I am a retired police officer.

686
33:13.840 --> 33:15.000
I have a brain tumor.

687
33:17.240 --> 33:20.240
The doctor said I will soon forget many things.

688
33:20.760 --> 33:23.280
So I write down all the important things.

689
33:24.800 --> 33:26.600
I have a son named Li Xin.

690
33:27.440 --> 33:29.800
He wanted to be a police officer when he was young.

691
33:29.800 --> 33:32.000
Now he is an excellent lawyer.

692
33:33.920 --> 33:35.360
To-do list.

693
33:36.040 --> 33:38.370
Write a piece of calligraphy for Xiaoxin.

694
33:40.080 --> 33:42.680
Xiaoxin visits me at home once a week.

695
33:43.280 --> 33:44.480
He likes things clean

696
33:44.520 --> 33:46.400
and prefers light-tasting food.

697
33:46.600 --> 33:48.600
There's no... no salt in this.

698
33:50.680 --> 33:51.520
I put a little.

699
33:52.160 --> 33:54.760
You're used to eating greasy and salty food,

700
33:54.920 --> 33:56.520
which is bad for your health.

701
33:57.280 --> 34:00.400
I must remember to remind him to bring less stuff.

702
34:00.800 --> 34:03.120
If you're not going to eat here every time,

703
34:03.120 --> 34:04.680
don't buy so much stuff.

704
34:04.840 --> 34:07.170
Look at the fridge. It's completely full.

705
34:08.000 --> 34:09.530
I can't eat it all by myself.

706
34:09.880 --> 34:12.920
I am divorced from Xiaoxin's mother, Guo Chunling.

707
34:14.120 --> 34:14.850
I'm leaving.

708
34:15.040 --> 34:18.760
When interacting with her, you must be careful with your boundaries.

709
34:18.760 --> 34:21.159
Don't put Xiaoxin in a difficult position.

710
34:22.639 --> 34:23.639
Remember that.

711
34:27.199 --> 34:28.560
Xiaoxin is injured

712
34:28.880 --> 34:30.719
and needs regular rehabilitation.

713
34:30.719 --> 34:34.050
On rainy days, you need to remind him to take care of himself.

714
34:49.719 --> 34:54.239
This was what I wanted to forget most in the past.

715
34:54.760 --> 34:57.920
But now that I'm sick and starting to forget things,

716
34:58.280 --> 35:01.480
it has become the thing I'm most afraid of forgetting.

717
35:03.320 --> 35:06.120
Because this is what I owe my son the most.

718
35:06.920 --> 35:07.800
That day

719
35:08.320 --> 35:11.180
not only left physical and mental scars on Xiaoxin,

720
35:12.080 --> 35:14.280
but also ruined his dream of being a cop.

721
35:14.880 --> 35:16.080
If I forget,

722
35:16.840 --> 35:19.080
my whole life would be in vain.

723
35:20.320 --> 35:22.440
I must keep it in mind.

724
35:23.080 --> 35:24.080
In my lifetime,

725
35:24.760 --> 35:27.720
I still owe my son an apology.

726
36:48.840 --> 36:49.720
Nurse, nurse!

727
36:49.720 --> 36:51.520
Could you tell me which room Li Guochen is in?

728
36:51.520 --> 36:52.360
Room 208.

729
36:52.760 --> 36:53.160
Thank you.

730
36:53.160 --> 36:53.760
Mom.

731
36:54.680 --> 36:55.440
Son.

732
36:55.880 --> 36:57.160
You got here so fast.

733
36:57.160 --> 36:58.920
You should have told me so I could pick you up.

734
36:58.920 --> 37:00.040
No need for that.

735
37:00.040 --> 37:02.080
Didn't I make it clear on the phone?

736
37:03.600 --> 37:04.760
How is your dad?

737
37:06.960 --> 37:10.520
How did your dad get such a disease?

738
37:10.520 --> 37:11.680
As the old saying goes,

739
37:11.680 --> 37:14.840
people with bad tempers are tough.

740
37:15.480 --> 37:17.520
Your dad will be fine.

741
37:21.280 --> 37:21.800
Well,

742
37:23.320 --> 37:25.200
you get back to work. I'll go see your dad.

743
37:25.200 --> 37:25.960
Thanks, Mom.

744
37:26.800 --> 37:27.760
Don't be silly.

745
37:27.760 --> 37:29.920
Mom is here. Don't worry.

746
37:30.720 --> 37:31.320
That room.

747
37:40.040 --> 37:42.120
Please take care of things in Xingang

748
37:42.600 --> 37:43.560
from now on.

749
37:44.000 --> 37:45.480
Thank you, Director.

750
37:46.280 --> 37:48.880
I will definitely prepare well when I get back.

751
37:48.880 --> 37:49.480
By the way,

752
37:51.000 --> 37:52.920
about the second trial for that farmer...

753
37:52.920 --> 37:54.880
I will handle this matter.

754
37:54.960 --> 37:56.000
That's great.

755
37:56.480 --> 37:57.400
With you stepping in, Director,

756
37:57.400 --> 37:59.530
there's nothing that can't be solved.

757
37:59.920 --> 38:00.520
Come in.

758
38:02.040 --> 38:02.720
Director.

759
38:04.080 --> 38:05.010
Then, Director,

760
38:05.440 --> 38:06.500
I won't bother you.

761
38:06.720 --> 38:07.850
I'll leave you to it.

762
38:11.760 --> 38:12.400
Director,

763
38:13.400 --> 38:15.240
all the information Lawyer Li found

764
38:15.240 --> 38:16.200
is here.

765
38:21.440 --> 38:22.500
You did a great job.

766
38:24.280 --> 38:25.740
Dali, you wanted to see me?

767
38:28.000 --> 38:29.530
What's up? Are you two cold?

768
38:31.560 --> 38:33.760
What does this mean? An interrogation?

769
38:37.880 --> 38:38.340
Come on.

770
38:48.080 --> 38:49.120
Explain.

771
38:49.800 --> 38:50.730
What's going on?

772
38:51.400 --> 38:53.520
Boss, don't believe him.

773
38:53.680 --> 38:56.800
We knew something was off about this kid.

774
38:56.880 --> 38:58.440
You've always been so good to him,

775
38:58.440 --> 38:59.720
yet he betrayed you.

776
39:12.920 --> 39:13.640
Bowen.

777
39:14.040 --> 39:16.770
Congratulations on the promotion, Partner Guo.

778
39:34.480 --> 39:35.610
Ungrateful wretch.

779
39:42.160 --> 39:43.240
Damn traitor.

780
39:48.520 --> 39:49.280
Got it.

781
39:50.520 --> 39:52.720
You want to know what I recorded, right?

782
39:52.960 --> 39:54.960
Here, let me play it for you.

783
39:58.120 --> 40:00.960
Dong Beihu is just a dog by the boss's side.

784
40:01.200 --> 40:03.520
He wags his tail and gets a bone.

785
40:03.920 --> 40:05.240
He did absolutely nothing.

786
40:05.240 --> 40:07.240
Yet the boss gave him a luxury car.

787
40:07.760 --> 40:10.320
We work ourselves to death for the boss.

788
40:10.440 --> 40:12.500
Yet we are worse than that dog eunuch.

789
40:14.680 --> 40:15.680
Want to hear more?

790
40:16.840 --> 40:18.370
Do you still want to listen?

791
40:19.320 --> 40:21.480
Dali, you can understand it.

792
40:22.560 --> 40:24.690
You don't need me to translate, right?

793
40:25.200 --> 40:27.460
You handed such a big business over to me.

794
40:27.680 --> 40:28.880
I want to do a good job.

795
40:29.000 --> 40:30.460
But they don't respect me.

796
40:30.680 --> 40:32.200
They usually speak in gibberish.

797
40:32.200 --> 40:33.320
And I don't understand it.

798
40:33.320 --> 40:34.360
So I figured,

799
40:35.080 --> 40:36.880
I'd record it and learn it.

800
40:36.880 --> 40:38.640
So I could communicate with them more.

801
40:38.640 --> 40:39.800
But I didn't expect

802
40:40.520 --> 40:42.800
them to talk about me like this behind my back.

803
40:42.800 --> 40:44.460
It's fine if they call me a dog.

804
40:45.160 --> 40:47.020
It's fine if they call me a eunuch.

805
40:48.120 --> 40:50.050
But they can't call me a dog eunuch.

806
40:50.360 --> 40:52.880
I know there's a reason they hate me.

807
40:53.000 --> 40:54.930
It's because you treat me too well.

808
40:55.440 --> 40:57.240
I didn't balance the relationship well.

809
40:57.240 --> 40:58.400
My EQ is too low.

810
40:58.520 --> 41:01.000
This is clearly bullying Brother Hu.

811
41:01.320 --> 41:01.960
Boss.

812
41:01.960 --> 41:02.720
Shut up.

813
41:11.360 --> 41:13.160
Alright, don't be mad.

814
41:14.880 --> 41:15.680
Listen up.

815
41:16.280 --> 41:17.480
This is my brother.

816
41:17.600 --> 41:18.520
Brother.

817
41:20.320 --> 41:21.560
From now on, anyone who messes with him

818
41:21.560 --> 41:23.360
messes with me. Got it?

819
41:23.520 --> 41:24.880
Got it, boss.

820
41:25.480 --> 41:26.440
Dali, get back to work.

821
41:26.440 --> 41:28.000
I'll go check the kitchen.

822
41:32.200 --> 41:33.120
Get lost!

823
41:47.160 --> 41:48.320
Not bad.

824
41:48.640 --> 41:50.040
Lawyer Guo is quite good.

825
41:50.040 --> 41:51.520
He is young and promising.

826
41:51.920 --> 41:52.640
I plan to

827
41:53.400 --> 41:54.880
let him take over Department Two

828
41:54.880 --> 41:57.560
and cooperate with Lawyer Shen to continue serving Xingang.

829
41:57.560 --> 41:59.120
Xingang has just been established.

830
41:59.120 --> 42:01.600
It indeed needs a lot of fresh blood.

831
42:01.920 --> 42:04.720
Thank you for your guidance, Mr. Wan and Director.

832
42:05.240 --> 42:05.760
Come.

833
42:06.680 --> 42:07.680
Work hard.

834
42:07.760 --> 42:10.200
In a couple of years, he will be a veteran.

835
42:17.240 --> 42:18.920
Sorry, I need to take a call.

836
42:20.840 --> 42:21.640
Come, Mr. Wan.

837
42:24.160 --> 42:25.400
Xiaolong, come here quickly.

838
42:25.400 --> 42:26.960
We found the unloading spot.

839
42:26.960 --> 42:27.640
Got it figured out?

840
42:27.640 --> 42:28.200
Yes.

841
42:28.480 --> 42:30.200
We split up to find it. Yes.

842
42:30.200 --> 42:32.280
The basic situation is...

843
42:32.480 --> 42:34.440
Here, here, and here.

844
42:34.480 --> 42:36.480
Yes, yes, yes. Here, here, and here.

845
42:36.480 --> 42:37.160
I searched the south.

846
42:37.160 --> 42:39.490
There, there, there. Yes, yes, yes. Here.

847
42:39.560 --> 42:41.560
There are basically more than 20 of these.

848
42:41.560 --> 42:43.000
They unloaded all around.

849
42:43.000 --> 42:43.400
Yes.

850
42:43.400 --> 42:45.440
Too cunning. Who are they guarding against?

851
42:45.440 --> 42:46.170
Sister Long,

852
42:46.400 --> 42:48.320
we only have three days left before the trial.

853
42:48.320 --> 42:50.080
Can we search all these places in time?

854
42:50.080 --> 42:51.280
We have to search even if we can't.

855
42:51.280 --> 42:52.560
Even finding one bag

856
42:52.560 --> 42:54.420
gives us hope of winning the case.

857
42:54.440 --> 42:56.370
Let's start searching right away.

858
42:57.000 --> 42:58.280
Grab your tools. Let's go.
